Zlib: gzip and deflate files and output compression, with the zlib of
the base system.

The module zlib of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20190902/zlib.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its headers in
include/php74/php/ext/zlib.
